OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 80, dies after being hit by
OL,4,Acar
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car in Ayr on Tuesday.
OL,9,FThe crash happened at about 17:30 on
OL,10,FCastlehill Road and involved a black
OL,11,FAudi. The pedestrian was taken to
OL,12,Fhospital for treatment but died the
OL,13,Ffollowing day.
OL,15,FThe driver and passenger of the Audi
OL,16,Fdid not require medical treatment.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland have appealed for any
OL,19,Fwitnesses to the incident to contact
OL,20,Fthe force with details.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
